        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDP25, Standard Duty Solid Brass Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on sliding pocket doors, the Sliding Pocket Door Pull comes with a passage function for doors that do not need to be locked like hallway and closets doors. Standard duty, it is for for use on 1-3/8\" thick pocket doors. The Passage Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Passage Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<table width=\"227\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDP25-Specifications.gif?v=1704354557\" width\"227\" height=\"235\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SDP25 Pocket Door Passage Set Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/privacy-pocket-door-lock-deltana-sdl25\">Pocket Door Privacy Lock</a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-passage-pocket-door-pull-deltana-sdpa325\">Pocket Door Passage Set for 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDP25 Pocket Door Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-1/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDP25.pdf?v=1691095376\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDP25 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDP25-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDP25 Installation Instructions (PDF)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
