                "description": "Pocket Door Passage Set Deltana SDP25 - For use on sliding pocket doors, the Sliding Pocket Door Pull comes with a passage function for doors that do not need to be locked like hallway and closets doors. Standard duty, it is for for use on 1-3/8\" thick pocket doors. The Passage Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware. Available in 10 finishes.  ",
